  "description": "Your kiss smelled of lemons. \n\nWhen Ga-Min steals a kiss from his sleeping classmate, Kang-Go, he’s positive he’ll never get caught. But what he doesn’t know is that Kang-Go has a unique gift — he can smell emotions. Now, Kang-Go’s on the hunt for the identity of his secret admirer, whether Ga-Min likes it or not. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 7 side story chapters.*",
